  "status_text": "A question with no recorded attempt until this afternoon; four hours later, a chain of checked results. What can a NOT gate save on a table when one row and one column are selected and gates read at most two wires? At 15:58 UTC a first floor was checked (L-meta-25766). At 16:12, a five-by-five case (L-meta-25469). Also the cost of removing NOT gates for all tables of side three and four (L-meta-25781, L-meta-25780). Now a wider floor: p + q - 1 gates, p and q the distinct rows and columns of a sub-table whose lines all hold both values (L-meta-29777). The general case is open (L-meta-19158).",
